3. Unicode Character Database files in this repository
-------------------------------------------------------

xtask/ucd/15.1.0/ holds UnicodeData.txt and SpecialCasing.txt from the
Unicode Character Database, version 15.1.0, unmodified. They are read only
by the development task `cargo xtask pack-embedder` (to build the
tokenizer's tables packed into the model file); they are not compiled into
the binaries. Copyright (c) 1991-2026 Unicode, Inc. They are distributed
under the Unicode License V3, whose full text is in
xtask/ucd/15.1.0/LICENSE.txt.


4. Token vocabulary in this repository
--------------------------------------

xtask/vocab/vocab-500.txt is trained here by xtask/vocab/train.py, which rebuilds
it deterministically (sources in manifest order, members by the SHA-256 of their
name, among equal frequencies the greatest pair of byte strings). It holds 500
short byte strings counted from the public text xtask/vocab/manifest.json names,
each source with its URL, commit, hash and licence (MIT, Apache-2.0, MIT or
Apache-2.0, BSD-3-Clause, or Unlicense or MIT); none of that text is in this
repository. It is compiled only into the development tasks in xtask, and into no
shipped binary.
